         bytes, an owned-skinned bundle whose Core view asks for a clip it lacks) passes them. These two run over the whole
         installed directory against the installed Core.zip and the deployed homm3_import.json. Opt-in through
         ValidateInstalledHomm3BundleDir, on by default since 2026-09-29 (the installed directory read back clean). -->
    <PropertyGroup>
      <Homm3BundleDeployModeActive>false</Homm3BundleDeployModeActive>
      <Homm3BundleDeployModeActive Condition="'$(DeployHomm3BundlesNormalized)' == 'true' or '$(DeployHomm3FactoryBulwarkBundlesNormalized)' == 'true' or '$(DeployHomm3BundleNameNormalized)' == 'true'">true</Homm3BundleDeployModeActive>
